# Uniques gained outside the registry (as the Great Sage scene's wishes are). Expect:
# - berserker (Rare, cap 3) via the registry for A, B, C; D gets it straight from Tensura → reconcile takes it
#   back and D holds another Rare instead ("TtlBotRecD holds: tensura:<some other rare>").
# - E gets seeker (Common) straight from Tensura → reconcile records it ("TtlBotRecE holds: tensura:seeker").
# - `ttl registry` lists berserker 3/3 and seeker 1/5.
ttlbot spawn TtlBotRecA
ttlbot spawn TtlBotRecB
ttlbot spawn TtlBotRecC
ttlbot spawn TtlBotRecD
ttlbot spawn TtlBotRecE
@sleep 4
ttl grant TtlBotRecA berserker
ttl grant TtlBotRecB berserker
ttl grant TtlBotRecC berserker
tensura edit ability grant TtlBotRecD tensura:berserker
tensura edit ability grant TtlBotRecE tensura:seeker
ttl reconcile TtlBotRecD
ttl reconcile TtlBotRecE
ttl registry
ttl reset TtlBotRecA
ttl reset TtlBotRecB
ttl reset TtlBotRecC
ttl reset TtlBotRecD
ttl reset TtlBotRecE
ttl registry
ttlbot remove TtlBotRecA
ttlbot remove TtlBotRecB
ttlbot remove TtlBotRecC
ttlbot remove TtlBotRecD
ttlbot remove TtlBotRecE
# Same flow for Tensura's Reset Counter bonus unique (gamerule resetCounterBonusUnique 1): a reset revokes what the
# player held and grants a bonus unique through Tensura itself, outside the registry. Simulated here: F holds a
# recorded unique, loses it and gets another one straight from Tensura. Reconcile must drop the old record and
# record the new one (or take it back and substitute one when its rarity is full), with history lines for both.
# Expect: `ttl registry expect ...` lines print "registry: ... as expected"; "ttl: ..." means a failure.
ttlbot spawn TtlBotRecF
@sleep 4
ttl grant TtlBotRecF seeker
ttl registry expect holds TtlBotRecF seeker true
tensura edit ability revoke TtlBotRecF tensura:seeker
tensura edit ability grant TtlBotRecF tensura:analyst
ttl reconcile TtlBotRecF
ttl registry expect holds TtlBotRecF seeker false
ttl registry expect holds TtlBotRecF analyst true
ttl registry expect has TtlBotRecF analyst true
ttl registry expect last TtlBotRecF grant analyst
ttl registry history analyst
ttl reset TtlBotRecF
ttlbot remove TtlBotRecF
